3. Problem Statement
The project aims to determine which customer characteristics are associated with churn and whether historical customer attributes can be used to predict churn. The intended analytical use is to help a telecommunications business identify customer segments that may warrant further investigation or retention analysis.
4. Dataset Description
The project uses the Telco Customer Churn dataset published on Kaggle. The Kaggle dataset describes it as an IBM Sample Data Set and states that it contains 7,043 customers and 21 columns, with Churn as the target variable. It contains demographic information, subscribed services, account information, charges, tenure, and whether a customer left within the last month.
Dataset source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/blastchar/telco-customer-churn
