7. Exploratory Data Analysis
Exploratory Data Analysis was performed to understand the distribution of churn and identify customer segments with different churn patterns. The notebook visualizes churn distribution, numerical feature distributions, contract type, internet service, payment method, tenure, monthly charges, and service usage.
•	Churn distribution is examined to understand the class balance.
•	Tenure is compared between churned and non-churned customers.
•	Monthly charges are compared across churn status.
•	Contract type is analyzed because contractual commitment can be associated with customer behavior.
•	Internet service and payment method are examined for differences in churn rates.
•	Security, backup, protection, and support services are analyzed to identify potentially important segments.
•	A correlation matrix is calculated for selected numerical variables.
8. Feature Engineering
Two additional analytical features are created. TenureGroup converts the continuous tenure value into interpretable customer-life-stage groups. TotalServices counts selected subscribed services. These features make segment-level analysis easier and can also contribute to predictive modeling.
9. Machine Learning Approach
The target variable Churn is converted to a binary value: 1 for Yes and 0 for No. The dataset is divided into training and testing subsets using an 80/20 split with stratification. Numerical variables are imputed and standardized, while categorical variables are imputed and one-hot encoded. These transformations are implemented within a scikit-learn ColumnTransformer and Pipeline to reduce the risk of data leakage.
9.1 Models
•	Logistic Regression — a linear classification baseline that is relatively interpretable.
•	Decision Tree — a rule-based model that can capture nonlinear relationships.
•	Random Forest — an ensemble of decision trees designed to improve generalization and capture complex patterns.
10. Evaluation Metrics
Metric	Purpose
Accuracy	Proportion of all predictions that are correct.
Precision	Among predicted churners, proportion that actually churned.
Recall	Among actual churners, proportion correctly identified.
F1-score	Harmonic mean of precision and recall.
ROC-AUC	Measures ranking/discrimination ability across classification thresholds.
Confusion Matrix	Shows counts of true/false positives and negatives.
